    explanation: 'Object Lifecycle Management supports the Delete and SetStorageClass actions (plus AbortIncompleteMultipartUpload). Versioning is a bucket setting you enable yourself, and lifecycle rules cannot move or copy objects to other locations or buckets; changing class happens in place.'
