    topic: 'Managing VMs & instance groups',
    difficulty: 'easy',
    verbatim: true,
    prompt: 'Your application servers are deployed in private subnet and you connect to an application instance using a bastion host, you connect to the bastion host using Console Shell and then ssh to the respective application instance. Unfortunately, Cloud Shell is taking a lot of time to respond and you manager wants you to ssh to the instance to fix an application specific configuration. What command would you use to SSH into the server from public end?',
