    answer: 1,
    explanation: 'Gradual traffic migration is only supported in the App Engine standard environment; in the flexible environment traffic moves immediately, so the new version takes the load cold. Warmup requests matter for standard, version names must be unique on deploy, and migration between separate flexible environments is not a feature. It is debatable because the option explains why gradual migration fails rather than directly naming latency as its cause.'
