    topic: 'Serverless operations',
    difficulty: 'easy',
    verbatim: true,
    prompt: 'A food delivery startup, MealDash, has its main website hosted on an App Engine standard environment. The team wants to test a new version of their site with 2% of their users while keeping the system as simple as possible. What should they do?',
